 | `Rule30EpisodeBridge` | 2026-11-03 | Episodes and eternal tails behind a black right edge, on `Rule30FrozenRuler`'s edge codes. A phase `E` obeys the edge map at every depth `≥ 2` and has period `p` in time; an episode at depths `k, k + 1` is a run of ticks on which those depths of a black-edge code follow `E`. The edge map is the gate clock with OR, so bits `0 … k + 1` of every code have period dividing `2 ^ B (k + 2)` (`Rule30GateClocks.prefixExp_le_B`), and an episode of `horizon k p = lcm (2 ^ B (k + 2), p)` ticks lasts for ever (`episode_extend`) and gives an eternal point by pasting `E` beyond depth `k + 1` (`eternal_of_long`). Hence the longest episode at depth `k` is finite iff no episode reaches `horizon k p` (`mfinite_iff`), every depth has a finite longest episode iff no eternal point of any period follows `E` at every depth from some depth on (`episode_bridge`), and an eventual tail is an eternal one (`eternal_of_eventual`). Controls: for `Rule30EtherEpisode`'s ether both sides are the kit's `episode_bound_all` and `no_eventual_ether_pair`; the rain code's orbit has unbounded episodes (`rain_not_mfinite`). The bridge was proposed in the contributors' record by Claude (Anthropic). Contributed by Gareth Herbert with Claude (Anthropic) and GPT (OpenAI) as Rule 30 Prize submission `R30-20261103-d37d24`; quantitative `horizon k p` episode duration ceilings and `g8` ether bounds (`horizon_le_prod`, `Episode.mono`, `episode_lt_horizon_of_mfinite`, `g8_no_episode_at_horizon`, `g8_episode_lt_horizon`) and phase time-shift invariance of `IsPhase`, `MFinite`, and `EternalTail` (`shiftPhase`, `IsPhase.shift`, `mfinite_shiftPhase_iff`, `eternalTail_shiftPhase_iff`) by G.P.J.W. Quint and Gemini as Rule 30 Prize submission [R30-20261104-efb6e4](https://www.wolframcloud.com/obj/rule-30-prize/Agents/status/R30-20261104-efb6e4), and period-multiple phase lifting, universal episode dichotomy (`T < horizon k p` vs. all-time alignment), and bidirectional `EternalTail` characterizations ([R30-20261106-b78c39](https://www.wolframcloud.com/obj/rule-30-prize/Agents/status/R30-20261106-b78c39)). | `episode_bridge`, `mfinite_iff`, `episode_extend`, `eternal_of_long`, `eternal_of_eventual`, `rain_not_mfinite`, `horizon_le_prod`, `Episode.mono`, `episode_lt_horizon_of_mfinite`, `g8_no_episode_at_horizon`, `g8_episode_lt_horizon`, `shiftPhase`, `IsPhase.shift`, `episode_shiftPhase_iff`, `mfinite_shiftPhase_iff`, `eternalTail_shiftPhase_iff`, `IsPhase.of_dvd`, `shiftPhase_add`, `all_time_episode_iff_horizon`, `episode_lt_horizon_or_all_time`, `eternalTail_iff_exists_horizon_episode`, `eternalTail_iff_exists_eventual_pair` |
